@startuml
title "Agent System Process"

rectangle "Task" as Task <<Task>>
rectangle "LLM" as LLM <<LLM>>
rectangle "Tools" as Tools <<Tools>>
rectangle "Environment" as Environment <<Environment>>

Task --> LLM : Task input to LLM
LLM --> Tools : LLM to Tools
Tools --> Environment : Action from Tools to Environment
Environment --> LLM : Result from Environment to LLM
LLM --> LLM : Reasoning loop

package "Agent" {
    LLM
    Tools
    Environment
}

legend
- Task is input to LLM.
- LLM performs Reasoning (self-loop) and sends an Action to Tools.
- Tools execute the Action in the Environment.
- Environment returns a Result to LLM.
- Agent (containing LLM, Tools, Environment) processes the cycle.
end legend
@enduml